  "reading": [
    "gzip_compress_into already write_all-s the full encoded section, then finish; it is not a per-record deflate.",
    "write_record_batch allocates a fresh CompressScratch; the produce worker reuses one via write_record_batch_scratch.",
    "Gateway packing is linger 100 ms or 1 MiB estimated record bytes, max in flight 1, eight explicit partitions.",
